{"id":"labio","lemma":"labio","pos":"noun","rank":1492,"glosses":["lip (fleshy protrusion around the opening of the mouth)","labium (fold of skin on either side of the vulva)"],"ipa":"/ˈlabjo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"labios"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cc/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-labio.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me mordí el labio.","en":"I bit my lip.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438057"},{"text":"Sus labios se encontraron.","en":"Their lips met.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735516"},{"text":"Él se mordió el labio.","en":"He bit his lip.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/637203"},{"text":"Mis labios están sellados.","en":"My lips are sealed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450486"},{"text":"Me ha salido una calentura en el labio.","en":"I've got a cold sore on my lip.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/728417"}]}